  "description" : "BRUT: Refined Design and Warm Ambiance\n\nThe BRUT collection combines a graphic design inspired by cracked concrete with a super-soft, refined surface, creating a modern yet warm atmosphere, perfect for the hospitality sector. Made from 100% polyamide, piece-dyed, with a pile weight of 510 g (52 pts), this saxony carpet provides comfort and durability for medium-traffic areas. Available in 6 colors, BRUT blends style and functionality, with a Class 31 rating and Cfl-s1 fire classification, ensuring welcoming and safe spaces.",
