  "datasheetPdf" : "https://www.carusflooring.com/images/common/collections/1/downloads/pdfDatasheet.pdf",
  "description" : "Golden Gate: Premium Polyamide Roll with Acoustic Backing – 4m Wide\n\nLooking for a high-quality and versatile solution for your design needs? The Golden Gate polyamide roll offers the perfect blend of comfort, durability, and style. With a generous width of 4 meters, it’s ideal for a variety of spaces and applications. Available in 4 stunning designs and 22 vibrant colors, this printed solution brings your vision to life with remarkable precision. Weighing in at 1300 grams, it provides an added layer of comfort, while the acoustic Fusion Backing enhances sound insulation for a quieter, more peaceful environment.\nIn stock and ready for immediate delivery, the Golden Gate roll is the ideal choice for both residential and commercial projects looking to combine aesthetics with functionality.",
