  "description" : "Original: Natural Sea Grass Flooring for a Timeless, Primitive Touch\n\nIntroducing Original, a flooring solution that brings a beautifully primitive feel to any space with a simple, yet striking color. Made from 100% sea grass, this natural flooring option is denser than its counterpart, Chevron, offering a robust, lasting design. With a total weight of 2250 grams, Original provides a durable, eco-friendly surface perfect for homes that value both style and sustainability.\nAvailable in a convenient 4-meter width, Original is designed to fit a variety of spaces throughout the home. Certified for medium residential use, it’s ideal for living rooms, bedrooms, and hallways, where it will add a warm, earthy vibe. The latex foam backing enhances comfort and ease of installation, making it a versatile choice for many interior styles. Bring nature into your home with Original—the perfect blend of beauty, strength, and natural elegance.",
